' UC-AGA-05 — Request Facility User Access Change

@startuml
skinparam conditionStyle inside
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFEAA7
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #DFE6E9

|Facility Administrator|
start
:1.0 Access access-change request function;

|WAHrden System|
:1.1 Verify authority and facility scope;
if (Authorized?) then (No [EF-01])
  :Present authorization denial;
  kill
else (Yes)
  :1.2 Present scoped user search function;
endif

|Facility Administrator|
:2.0 Enter user search criteria;

|WAHrden System|
:2.1 Search users within authorized facility scope;
if (Matching user found?) then (No [EF-02])
  :Present no-match result;
  kill
else (Yes)
  :Present matching users;
endif

|Facility Administrator|
:2.2 Select target centralized user;

|WAHrden System|
:2.3 Present user's current facility-specific access;

|Facility Administrator|
:3.0 Specify requested access change;

|WAHrden System|
:3.1 Validate requested changes;
if (Outside authorized facility scope?) then (Yes [EF-04])
  :Present scope validation error;
  kill
elseif (Change invalid or incomplete?) then (Yes [EF-03])
  :Present validation issue & allow revision;
  kill
else (Valid)
  :3.2 Present proposed request summary;
endif

|Facility Administrator|
if (Confirm submission?) then (No / Cancel [EF-05])
  :Cancel request submission;
  kill
else (Yes [3.3])
  :Confirm submission;
endif

|WAHrden System|
:4.0 Create access-change request in 'Pending' state;
if (Submission successful?) then (No [EF-06])
  :Present submission processing failure;
  kill
else (Yes)
  |Database / Audit|
  :4.1 Record access-change request & audit trail;
  
  |WAHrden System|
  :4.2 Present Pending request confirmation;
endif

|Facility Administrator|
:Acknowledge submission confirmation;
stop
@enduml
